//! 🧪️ Acceptance test 2: a trait with >=40 methods (generated by this file's own build step, not
//! typed by hand) proves the macro scales to `BrepKernel`'s 92 / `PluginApp`'s 51 without blowing up
//! compile time or producing incorrect delegation on any one of them.
#![allow(async_fn_in_trait)] // R7 — never resolved by `+ Send` or by making a method sync.

use semio_framework_dispatch_macros::{dyn_enum, dyn_enum_close};

//#region 🔖️45-method trait (alternating async/sync)

